OL,3,GNEWSALeaders react to council shake-up
OL,4,Apause
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Lincolnshire County
OL,7,FCouncil has welcomed news that a major
OL,8,Fshake-up of local government is to be
OL,9,Fput on hold.
OL,11,FThe plans to scrap district and county
OL,12,Fcouncils and create larger unitary
OL,13,Fauthorities were paused on Monday after
OL,14,Fthe government launched a review in
OL,15,Flight of new legal advice.
OL,17,FLincolnshire County Council leader Sean
OL,18,FMatthews said: "I'm pleased the
OL,19,Fgovernment's made this decision and I
OL,20,Fhope it becomes a more permanent one."
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
