OL,3,GNEWSALeaders react to council shake-up
OL,4,Apause
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Richard Wright, leader of
OL,7,FNorth Kesteven District Council, said:
OL,8,F"It's not about being pleased. It's
OL,9,Fbeing concerned that we're actually
OL,10,Fback into a time of uncertainty."
